1. `0 is a integer until you explicitly not change its type ` : `max(0,m)` where m 
    is long long then we will encounter a error that is argument list inside max 
    function is not same `max(0ll,m)` as max works only on same data type variables 
    only. and this will extend until the range of int means any positive or negative
    number written directly in this manner will be int by default if fall under the 
    range of int and then  long int and  long long int . 
